                <pb facs="0334" n="234" sameAs="frus:frus1934v01/pg234"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A5/43: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1934-05-03T22:00:00-04:00">May 3, 1934—10
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>64. Your 88, May 3, 11 a.m. The position you took in conversation with Vice
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs is entirely satisfactory.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
